ys silently default share3945310318 PRRT_kwDOIvux3s6fvJLQ; embedded credential URL rejection3945310329 PRRT_kwDOIvux3s6fvJLV (duplicates older credential leakage); bootstrap_completed missing lock on #9 3945310331 PRRT_kwDOIvux3s6fvJLX (#10 already holds lock, consider moving earlier). #12849 and #12838/#12843 had no unresolved threads at start. No new substantive CI failure logs because normal tests weren't dispatched while root PR conflicted.\n\n\n## Latest completed push: September 6 empty-directory clarification and feedback fixes\n\nIMPORTANT live post-push check: foundation #12849 now reports CONFLICTING against main (main advanced during this pass). Upper five mergeability UNKNOWN recalculating; Bugbot/Greptile pending, no new failed checks yet. Next pass must fetch main, inspect/resolve foundation conflicts, and restack upward with the new expected remote heads below. Do not treat earlier old-head MERGEABLE status as current.\n\nAtomic push25288 SUCCEEDED with exact expected-head leases, no unexpected remote changes. Current remote heads (new expected leases): foundation a04a62048f1b9e732079695ea56fa31c9c8f4e95; rollback dbb901d759077b99252673f196bc54c75217f615; services 3edad6aa844c2b560a8eb0825d0d94d150ba1c57; watcher 3b00de37eebf7591d618db6edb8b75b5874b89cb; origin 7a9037390fa6e5c2184c1f34829b55ff765da94d; auto 5cb5808be0e2a8c42667cbf47b854a19dc26fcc0. All worktrees clean, all tool sessions COMPLETE. Encryption and blog untouched.\n\nFinal integrated verification PASS: 25 sync unit tests (5363), full render59235, lint-fix73201, E2E72983: sync_permissions, sync_preflight, sync_auto (conflict notification/logo/dedup, failure age/recovery), bootstrap_from_git (templates, dry-run, ordinary released workflow without experimental). Rollback policy test passed on owning PR. See implemented details below. The top permission fixture was adapted in 5cb5808 because #10 local origin settings eliminate the initial global-config conflict; this was a test adjustment, not ignored runtime failure.\n\nPosted evidence replies and resolved 12 addressed findings: 3945196711,3945191965,3945192931,3944671864,3944671868,3944731605,3944731632,3944731679,3944731682,3945123072,3945123081,3945123083. Reply URLs discussion_r3945277889 through discussion_r3945278853. Earlier this pass replied/resolved false release-scope finding3944731610 at r3945264941. Do not repost. Empty-folder reply records maintainer's explicit choice to leave them alone, plus the ancestor-deletion protection we implemented.\n\nNext: monitor CI on NEW pushed heads and continue outstanding queue listed below. This is NOT settled/merge-ready yet. Existing every30min heartbeat remains ACTIVE. Failure-streak and backup reupload findings now have fresh integrated test evidence (sync_auto and three backup unit tests); code is in #10, consider earliest-owner placement before resolving. Other unresolved origin URL/privacy, Windows hook path, local mode precedence, and full remote preview findings remain. No merges.\n\n\n## Latest in-progress feedback pass, September 6 (supersedes below)\n\nUser confirmed: parent rollback must LEAVE UNRECORDED EMPTY FOLDERS ALONE. Implemented in #12835: skip automatic deletion of emptied ancestors when an empty descendant existed before rollback; explicit selection of an empty directory still removes it and undo restores it. Docs and test_dotfiles_rollback_review updated; E2E, lint-fix, render PASS.\n\nAll work is local, NOT PUSHED yet. Expected remote heads remain a04a62048/e7189cafd/a479dc518/408b965525/ab0f1444/ef91e777 in the preceding push section below. Verified unchanged. Foundation unchanged. Current restacked local heads:\n- rollback dbb901d759077b99252673f196bc54c75217f615\n- services 3edad6aa844c2b560a8eb0825d0d94d150ba1c57\n- watcher 3b00de37eebf7591d618db6edb8b75b5874b89cb\n- origin 7a9037390fa6e5c2184c1f34829b55ff765da94d\n- auto 79e625e5224f1853d8669d053ee6e22996da9b41 plus dirty test_dotfiles_sync_permissions fixture (pull --yes, no