{"timestamp":"2026-09-06T22:28:09.520Z","ordinal":9957,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02be90ffdd5dff4a016a9de8e1280887d0bbc84e0644d31c92","status":"completed","call_id":"call_ABvIuECyPlh3qskkh42uH5mB","name":"exec","input":"const rows=[\n[12835,3945285524,\"PRRT_kwDOIvux3s6fvFHf\",\"Addressed in 5399cb731. Optional cleanup now preserves a directory if an empty-descendant inspection fails instead of aborting parent rollback. This also preserves the maintainer's choice to leave unrecorded empty folders alone. Added an unreadable-child regression to test_dotfiles_rollback_review; it passed on the owning branch and the integrated stack. Full render and lint-fix passed.\"],\n[12865,3945310321,\"PRRT_kwDOIvux3s6fvJLR\",\"Addressed in bbecdbe4c. Publication rejects empty variant stream names and names containing '/' or '@' before building the branch path, so a variant cannot alter the stream/path mapping. The variants_cannot_change_the_stream_or_local_path unit regression passed, including the integrated encryption sync suite (39 tests). Render and lint-fix passed.\"],\n[12865,3945310318,\"PRRT_kwDOIvux3s6fvJLQ\",\"Addressed in 9b5ba2b5e. Incoming whole-file declarations now reject unknown policy keys before any application; the released local parser is unchanged. test_dotfiles_sync_preflight verifies that shrae=false pauses the incoming setup and leaves the existing configuration untouched. It passed on the owning and integrated branches. #12895 extends the allowed keys with encrypt, verified by the encrypted-file E2E.\"],\n[12882,3945294364,\"PRRT_kwDOIvux3s6fvGkw\",\"Addressed in 4281da00d. Purge reuses its held sync lock through remove_locked rather than reacquiring it during disconnect; ordinary remove acquires that same lock before configuration writes. test_dotfiles_sync_permissions now verifies successful purge, disconnection, removal of machine refs, and preservation of the shared branch. Passed on #12882 and with encryption integrated; render/lint passed.\"],\n[12903,3945434686,\"PRRT_kwDOIvux3s6fvdGE\",\"Addressed in 531b9bfc5. The destination preview and backup count now exclude walk.private, matching the backup builder's private coverage exclusion. Added an E2E for a tracked .local.toml file: the preview reports local history only, not plaintext remote backup. test_dotfiles_onboarding, test_dotfiles_track, and test_dotfiles_sync all passed, along with full render and lint-fix.\"],\n[12903,3945434689,\"PRRT_kwDOIvux3s6fvdGG\",\"Addressed in 531b9bfc5. Guidance is derived from each resulting declaration's autosave policy, not just the supplied flag. Retracking a manual-save entry still reports manual saving; mixed batches can also report watcher health for their automatic entries. The new retrack regression in test_dotfiles_onboarding passed, as did tracking/sync E2Es, render, and lint-fix.\"],\n[12903,3945435719,\"PRRT_kwDOIvux3s6fvdQr\",\"Addressed in 531b9bfc5. Variant deduplication compares the selector (os/profile/default), excluding its share policy, so retracking a private OS variant retains its policy without creating a second matching selector. Added an E2E that tracks with --os and --private, retracks the same --os, and checks it remains active with share=false and backup=false. Onboarding/tracking/sync E2Es, render, and lint-fix passed.\"]\n];\nstore(\"reviewReplies\",rows);\nconst query='{ nodes(ids:['+rows.map(x=>JSON.stringify(x[2])).join(\",\")+']) { ... on PullRequestReviewThread { id isResolved } } }';\nconst q=s=>\"'\"+s.replaceAll(\"'\",\"'\\\\''\")+\"'\";\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"gh api graphql -f query=\"+q(query),workdir:\"/Users/jdx/.codex/worktrees/dotfiles-onboarding/mise\",max_output_tokens:1600}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a078ac-bf7f-7050-adcc-4d223220149d","create_time":1788733655.773168}}}
