{"timestamp":"2026-09-06T22:33:39.027Z","ordinal":10118,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a07177-9855-71a2-89cd-4a9a37cdbfcb","turn_id":"01a078d9-c0cd-7843-901a-b76dfa554ca0","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_02be90ffdd5dff4a016a9dea4194c887d09f6cf9b2ea51a310","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"The capture PR rebased cleanly apart from generated docs. I also verified a review finding: if a command edits a file and removes its tracking declaration, the outcome checkpoint can miss the edit. I’m fixing that before restacking the recovery tests on top.\n"}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1788734017547,"completed_at_ms":1788734019027}}
