3043","id":"ctc_02be90ffdd5dff4a016a9de92be0bc87d0945292910ac03089","input":"const wd=\"/Users/jdx/.codex/worktrees/dotfiles-onboarding/mise\",q=s=\u003e\"'\"+s.replaceAll(\"'\",\"'\\\\''\")+\"'\";\nfor(const [pr,head,run,paragraph] of [\n[12895,\"7ec3e38b7\",34064079051,\"Rebased onto the current experimental dotfiles stack, preserving status locking, corrupt-state handling, permission-aware reconciliation, and backup deduplication. Incoming validation accepts `encrypt`. Ordinary backup uploads cannot overwrite an existing remote checkpoint; encryption-policy changes retain the dedicated replacement transaction. Local checks passed: 39 sync unit tests, 13 age tests, encrypted-file and encrypted-backup E2Es, encryption schema, permission/purge and preflight regressions, full render, and lint-fix. Real Secure Enclave/TPM hardware remains untested.\"],\n[12903,\"531b9bfc5\",34064079038,\"Rebased onto the current encryption stack. Fixed all three initial findings: private-file backup previews now match upload eligibility; retracking reports the resulting autosave policy; private OS/profile variants are not duplicated when retracked. Added onboarding regressions and retained the experimental opt-in. Local onboarding, tracking, and full two-machine sync E2Es passed, including whole-setup pauses, incremental conflict resolution, stale-edit protection, and declined-origin state isolation. Full render and lint-fix passed.\"]\n]){\nconst got=await tools.exec_command({cmd:`gh pr view ${pr} --repo jdx/mise --json body`,workdir:wd,max_output_tokens:12000});\nlet body=JSON.parse(got.output).body;\nif(pr===12903)body=body.replace(\"The existing sync E2E is being rerun after preserving its expected unattended-refusal wording.\",\"The existing sync E2E also passes with the expected unattended-refusal wording.\");\nbody+=`\\n\\n## Current stack integration (${head})\\n\\n${paragraph}\\n\\nCI dispatched for this exact head: [test workflow](https://github.com/jdx/mise/actions/runs/${run}); results pending.\\n\\n*AI-assisted — Tool: Codex; model: unavailable; version: unavailable.*\\n`;\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:`gh pr edit ${pr} --repo jdx/mise --body `+q(body),workdir:wd,max_output_tokens:500}));\n}\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1788733725.859912,"turn_id":"01a078ac-bf7f-7050-adcc-4d223220149d"},"name":"exec","status":"completed","type":"custom_tool_call"},{"call_id":"call_pQ3243qxksGy5ZLfUPbl3043","id":"ctco_01a078d7-180b-7242-82d9-7cdda100ae29","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1788733757.451625,"turn_id":"01a078ac-bf7f-7050-adcc-4d223220149d"},"output":[{"text":"Script completed\nWall time 3.8 seconds\nOutput:\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"c9332b\",\"wall_time_seconds\":1.311900959,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":10,\"output\":\"https://github.com/jdx/mise/pull/12895\\n\"}","type":"input_text"},{"text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"dc275c\",\"wall_time_seconds\":1.225182625,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":10,\"output\":\"https://github.com/jdx/mise/pull/12903\\n\"}","type":"input_text"}],"type":"custom_tool_call_output"},{"encrypted_content":"REDACTED","id":"rs_02be90ffdd5dff4a016a9de940519c87d08da5eb52cb0c642a","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a078ac-bf7f-7050-adcc-4d223220149d"},"summary":[],"type":"reasoning"},{"content":[{"text":"All eight PRs are pushed and currently mergeable. CI is running on each exact head, and I’ve replied with test evidence to seven addressed findings. The ongoing feedback checks now include both encryption and the onboarding follow-up.\n","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_02be90ffdd5dff4a016a9de94232f887d09342c8ad34d7a6d1","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["unknown"],"create_time":1788733758.014697,"turn_id":"01a078ac-bf7f-7050-adcc-4d223220149d"},"phase":"commentary","role":"assistant","type":"message"},{"call_id":"call_zn16ySjwNnkPWF7Sc1el5Mz6","id":"ctc_02be90ffdd5dff4a016a9de943af0c87d0abfef38d6a2807ed","input":"text(await tools.apply_patch(\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/jdx/.codex/worktrees/dotfiles-takeover/TAKEOVER.md\\n@@\\n # Dotfiles stack takeover\\n+\\n+## Latest completed push: eight-PR stack including encryption and onboarding\\n+\\n+Atomic exact-lease push60945 SUCCEEDED, no unexpected remote changes. All eight PRs verified MERGEABLE and non-draft after push. Expected remote heads now:\\n+- #12849 bootstrap/5-track = 3f967b8809e2d12163c31e0237adabc299532b68\\n+- #12835 bootstrap/6-rollback = 19b1756b5d7bdf16b0e7310f170111a46ae43de6\\n+- #12838 bootstrap/7-user-services = 384a89a2fdb45a970f653550f43a9e8450a76340\\n+- #12843 bootstrap/8-watch = 7e0e5584b36ee6bfaa3bd65b37399e64c29497b1\\n+- #12865 bootstrap/9-origin = 996764d5f2fd87e95278395570c69d2fac2418b5\\n+- #12882 bootstrap/10-auto-sync = 4281da00d537de7fd9751ed7133277f5acbead39\\n+- #12895 bootstrap/11-encrypted-backups = 7ec3e38b7e9fbc2aac38d70f8a925b0d439d8a40\\n+- #12903 codex/dotfiles-launch-readiness = 531b9bfc5a2f1b1df3c17bd76c05e21347676b0e\\n+\\n+Local worktrees/branches as below, all clean after commits. No tool sessions remain running. Top render/lint/E2Es session36666 PASS; duplicate parallel E2E16107 also PASS. E2Es onboarding, track, full two-machine sync cover all three #12903 fixes and prior core contract. Encryption full verification recorded below. Original141d and other agentf730 untouched. No merges; blog unchanged here.\\n+\\n+Explicit test.yml CI dispatched and headSha verified for all eight: #12849=34064079053; #12835=34064078985; #12838=34064078972; #12843=34064079030; #12865=34064079123; #12882=34064078971; #12895=34064079051; #12903=34064079038. Last snapshot builds/windows/macOS running or queued, no substantive failure yet. Must inspect these runs, not stale original-head CI. Updated #12895/#12903 descriptions with current integration evidence and pending CI links. Real Secure Enclave/TPM hardware remains untested.\\n+\\n+Posted evidence replies for seven findings: 3945285524 -\u003e r3945462752; 3945310321 -\u003e r3945462751; 3945310318 -\u003e r3945462754; 3945294364 -\u003e r3945462749; 3945434686 -\u003e r3945462757; 3945434689 -\u003e r3945462748; 3945435719 -\u003e r3945462760. Resolved the four still open; three had already been resolved by bots after push. Do not repost. Older unresolved origin/auto review queue below remains and fresh reviews may arrive. #12895 had no unresolved findings when inspected. Git-for-Windows hooksPath finding not dismissed: upstream docs recommend /dev/null and wrappers special-case exact path, but appended hook-name behavior still needs platform verification; do not assert invalid based only on fopen mapping.\\n+\\n+Heartbeat settle-dotfiles-pr-stack ACTIVE every30min and now explicitly includes ALL EIGHT. Keep checking feedback/failing checks/merge conflicts until settled. Preserve completed encryption, no plaintext fallback. Stop unexpected pushes. This stack is not yet declared settled or CI-verified.\\n*** End Patch\"));\ntext(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"git status --short\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/jdx/.codex/worktrees/dotfiles-onboarding/mise\",\"max_output_tokens\":500}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1788733758.014697,"turn_id":"01a078ac-bf7f-7050-adcc-4d223220149d"},"name":"exec","status":"completed","type":"custom_tool_call"},{"call_id":"call_zn16ySjwNnkPWF7Sc1el5Mz6","id":"ctco_01a078d7-9c2d-77f1-be46-2bed2279b881","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1788733791.277957,"turn_id":"01a078ac-bf7f-7050-adcc-4d223220149d"},"output":[{"text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.2 seconds\nOutput:\n","type":"input_text"},{"text":"{}","type":"input_text"},{"text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"84b0a2\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000003375,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":0,\"output\":\"\"}","type":"input_text"}],"type":"custom_tool_call_output"},{"content":[{"text":"Included [encryption #12895](https://github.com/jdx/mise/pull/12895) and [its follow-up #12903](https://github.com/jdx/mise/pull/12903).\n\nRestacked and pushed all eight, fixed integration/review issues, and posted verification evidence. Local checks passed; all eight are mergeable. CI is running, and ongoing monitoring covers the expanded stack.\n\nNothing merged.","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_02be90ffdd5dff4a016a9de9618ae487d0a676f1fc8fda5058","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["unknown"],"create_time":1788733792.012937,"turn_id":"01a078ac-bf7f-7050-adcc-4d223220149d"},"phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"include the entire stack, there's 2 more prs i think\n","type":"input_text"}],"id":"msg_01a078d8-935a-7a60-af1c-b62e81bb6e36","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["user.text"],"create_time":1788733854.554576,"turn_id":"01a078d8-8fe1-7512-8383-08263a40e40e"},"role":"user","type":"message"},{"content":[{"text":"I’ll check the full branch chain for the missing PRs and add them to the ongoing checks.\n","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_02be90ffdd5dff4a016a9de9a65ec887d0948c42140a090db4","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"content_item_kinds":["unknown"],"turn_id":"01a078d8-8fe1-7512-8383-08263a40e40e"},"phase":"commentary","role":"assistant","type":"message"},{"call_id":"call_0ot7w5G8Aljvk2zHrlq07KGe","id":"ctc_02be90ffdd5dff4a016a9de9a7f70887d08092f193905bc8f5","input":"text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:\"gh pr list --repo jdx/mise --state open --limit 100 --json number,title,headRefName,baseRefName,headRefOid\",\"max_output_tokens\":7000}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"create_time":1788733856.333374,"turn_id":"01a078d8-8fe1-7512-8383-08263a40e40e"},"name":"exec","status":"completed","type":"custom_tool_call"},{"call_id":"call_0ot7w5G8Aljvk2zHrlq07KGe","id":"ctco_01a078d8-bd79-7322-a274-16ba9b06adc3","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"cre