{"timestamp":"2026-09-06T22:41:51.174Z","ordinal":10283,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a078e2-9846-70d1-9548-5fa16824df55","call_id":"call_mMa5tYElr4jQHsvkW1xWIXYK","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 0.2 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"32611e\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000004708,\"exit_code\":2,\"original_token_count\":182,\"output\":\"rg: src/age.rs: No such file or directory (os error 2)\\ndocs/history.md:371:the age key at `settings.age.key_file` (default `~/.config/mise/age.txt`)\\ndocs/history.md:380:`settings.age.identity_files`, `settings.age.key_file`, or the default\\ndocs/history.md:381:`age.txt` and SSH keys); the identity file itself is a credential store,\\ndocs/history.md:579:(`github_tokens.toml`, `age.txt`, `*.key`, …) are neither shared nor backed\\ndocs/history.md:660:local identity file with `settings.age.identity_files`. Native `age1tag` public\\nsettings.toml:32:[age.identity_files]\\nsettings.toml:41:default_docs = \\\"~/.config/mise/age.txt\\\"\\nsettings.toml:47:[age.ssh_identity_files]\\nsettings.toml:2968:default_docs = \\\"~/.config/mise/age.txt\\\"\\n\"}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"294332\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000003166,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":3364,\"output\":\"Warning: truncated output (original token count: 3364)\\nTotal output lines: 65\\n\\n# Dotfiles stack takeover\\n\\n## Scope correction: entire TEN-PR stack\\n\\nUser explicitly requested the entire stack, including two more PRs. Live open-PR branch-chain inventory confirms #12904 feat(dotfiles): capture history around external commands (base codex/dotfiles-launch-readiness, head codex/dotfiles-command-capture, expected remote a71e43940353081e9272ee2ce068b75d3cbc94c2), then #12905 test(dotfiles): exercise recovery across three machines (base codex/dotfiles-command-capture, head codex/dotfiles-recovery-acceptance, expected remote c627ea6233fba82722e031c4e3ceda97f833319d). #12904 currently CONFLICTING against the updated #12903; #12905 currently MERGEABLE against its old base. Neither new branch has been edited or restacked by this task yet. Prioritize integration/restack/testing both in isolated worktrees with exact-head leases. The earlier eight-head local verification does NOT verify these two layers.\\n\\nExisting heartbeat updated to cover ALL TEN, plus rediscover the full open base/head chain on each pass to avoid missing additional descendants. Existing eight current heads and CI run IDs below remain unchanged. No new automation created. Do not declare settled until capture, three-machine recovery acceptance, review feedback, and CI on both new heads are included. No merges.\\n\\n## Latest completed push: eight-PR stack including encryption and onboarding\\n\\nAtomic exact-lease push60945 SUCCEEDED, no unexpected remote changes. All eight PRs verified MERGEABLE and non-draft after push. Expected remote heads now:\\n- #12849 bootstrap/5-track = 3f967b8809e2d12163c31e0237adabc299532b68\\n- #12835 bootstrap/6-rollback = 19b1756b5d7bdf16b0e7310f170111a46ae43de6\\n- #12838 bootstrap/7-user-services = 384a89a2fdb45a970f653550f43a9e8450a76340\\n- #12843 bootstrap/8-watch = 7e0e5584b36ee6bfaa3bd65b37399e64c29497b1\\n- #12865 bootstrap/9-origin = 996764d5f2fd87e95278395570c69d2fac2418b5\\n- #12882 bootstrap/10-auto-sync = 4281da00d537de7fd9751ed7133277f5acbead39\\n- #12895 bootstrap/11-encrypted-backups = 7ec3e38b7e9fbc2aac38d70f8a925b0d439d8a40\\n- #12903 codex/dotfiles-launch-readiness = 531b9bfc5a2f1b1df3c17bd76c05e21347676b0e\\n\\nLocal worktrees/branches as below, all clean after commits. No tool sessions remain running. Top render/lint/E2Es session36666 PASS; duplicate parallel E2E16107 also PASS. E2Es onboarding, track, full two-machine sync cover all three #12903 fixes and prior core contract. Encryption full verification recorded below. Original141d and other agentf730 untouched. No mer