{"timestamp":"2026-09-06T22:45:52.629Z","ordinal":10404,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call_output","id":"ctco_01a078e6-4775-78a2-8ebf-5a5a905588d3","call_id":"call_VDZECEr4IRFyCBxVm4nAfk5P","output":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Script completed\nWall time 10.2 seconds\nOutput:\n"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"21a951\",\"wall_time_seconds\":5.00122375,\"session_id\":32467,\"original_token_count\":88,\"output\":\"  cargo-check –     Checking flate2 v1.1.10\\n  cargo-check –     Checking compression-codecs v0.4.38\\n  cargo-check –     Checking zip v8.6.0\\n  cargo-check –     Checking pgp v0.20.0\\n  cargo-check –     Checking async-compression v0.4.43\\n  cargo-check –     Checking tower-http v0.6.11\\n  cargo-check –     Checking astral_async_zip v0.0.20\\n\"}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"452936\",\"wall_time_seconds\":5.000468584,\"session_id\":38121,\"original_token_count\":159,\"output\":\"  cargo-check –     Finished `dev` profile [unoptimized + debuginfo] target(s) in 19.69s\\n  cargo-check – mbx[savings]: has saved 6h 18m across 508 builds. this line is the only thanks it needs.\\n✔ cargo-check\\nmise WARN  GitHub OAuth refresh was rejected (incorrect_client_credentials): The client_id and/or client_secret passed are incorrect.. Reauthorization is required; run `mise token github --oauth --refresh`\\n   Compiling mise-interactive-config v2026.1.12 (/Users/jdx/.codex/worktrees/dotfiles-services/mise/crates/mise-interactive-config)\\n   Compiling mise v2026.9.1 (/Users/jdx/.codex/worktrees/dotfiles-services/mise)\\n\"}"},{"type":"input_text","text":"{\"chunk_id\":\"063c4d\",\"wall_time_seconds\":0.000002958,\"exit_code\":0,\"original_token_count\":55,\"output\":\" M docs/history.md\\n M e2e/cli/test_dotfiles_recovery_journey\\n docs/history.md                        | 9 ++++++---\\n e2e/cli/test_dotfiles_recovery_journey | 7 ++++++-\\n 2 files changed, 12 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)\\n\"}"}],"internal_