ted (incorrect_client_credentials): The client_id and/or client_secret passed are incorrect.. Reauthorization is required; run `mise token github --oauth --refresh`\\nmise WARN  GitHub OAuth refresh was rejected (incorrect_client_credentials): The client_id and/or client_secret passed are incorrect.. Reauthorization is required; run `mise token github --oauth --refresh`\\n[lint-fix] $ ~/.codex/worktrees/dotfiles-watcher/mise/xtasks/lint-fix.sh\\n+ hk fix --all --exclude vendor/aqua-registry\\n  files - Fetching git status\\n  files - Fetching all files in repo\\n  files - Fetching all files in repo (3557 files)\\n✔ files - Fetching all files in repo (3557 files)\\n❯ schema\\n  schema – 6 files – schema/**/*.json – xargs -0 -I {} ajv compile -s {} --spec=draft2020 --strict-types=true --strict-tuples=true\\n❯ cargo-fmt\\n❯ cargo-check\\n  cargo-fmt – 578 files – **/*.rs – cargo fmt --all -- --check\\n❯ shellcheck  [                  ] 0/19\\n  shellcheck – 16 files – *.sh xtasks/** scripts/** e2e/** – shellcheck -x scripts/test-bootstrap-linux-host.sh …\\n  shellcheck – 55 files – *.sh xtasks/** scripts/** e2e/** – shellcheck -x e2e/config/test_hooks_global …\\n  cargo-check – 578 files – **/*.rs – cargo check --all-features\\n  shellcheck – 55 files – *.sh xtasks/** scripts/** e2e/** – shellcheck -x e2e/tasks/test_task_tools_env_cache …\\n  shellcheck – 55 files – *.sh xtasks/** scripts/** e2e/** – shellcheck -x e2e/tasks/test_task_monorepo_config_dedup …\\n  shellcheck – 55 files – *.sh xtasks/** scripts/** e2e/** – shellcheck -x e2e/style.sh …\\n  shellcheck – 55 files – *.sh xtasks/** scripts/** e2e/** – shellcheck -x e2e/tasks/test_task_prefix_color …\\n  shellcheck – 55 files – *.sh xtasks/** scripts/** e2e/** – shellcheck -x e2e/cli/test_bootstrap_system_files_no_sudo …\\n❯ shfmt  [                  ] 0/19\\n❯ pkl\\n  pkl – 1 file – **/*.pkl – pkl eval hk.pkl >/dev/null\\n  shfmt – 55 files – *.sh xtasks/** scripts/** e2e/** – shfmt -d --apply-ignore benchmarks