{"timestamp":"2026-09-06T22:53:25.522Z","ordinal":10561,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02be90ffdd5dff4a016a9deec3e22887d0ac9cd37e92450c66","status":"completed","call_id":"call_LM6XNRwW6K7pZwcxQwa6YSVE","name":"exec","input":"text(await tools.apply_patch(\"*** Begin Patch\\n*** Update File: /Users/jdx/.codex/worktrees/dotfiles-takeover/TAKEOVER.md\\n@@\\n # Dotfiles stack takeover\\n+\\n+## In progress: restack all ten and continue (September 6)\\n+\\n+All ten locally restacked; NO PUSH YET in this pass. First two unchanged. Local heads before final capture source-link fix:\\n+- services codex/dotfiles-restack-7 f04f0a0f1ab13ec1309591e75f565835943d80f5\\n+- watcher codex/dotfiles-restack-8 2784ec51e5892061ef09e3ae8c565d0b2af9e377\\n+- origin codex/dotfiles-restack-9 7b62f6b41270ab3022cedbbbb3a34e9a435c109d\\n+- auto codex/dotfiles-auto-fixes be07b97d6901cae3c46ee069faae3dde89098e12\\n+- encryption codex/dotfiles-encryption-checks 8130822602a98fd408c11a029242a486fee0983b\\n+- onboarding codex/dotfiles-onboarding-checks bae0488b243834d4d23025f21a088e5a0b2dc154\\n+- capture codex/dotfiles-capture-checks 2310455137a2bf65dbec1ad7198be657ab421cab\\n+- recovery codex/dotfiles-recovery-checks cb65aeb386428e8abb8a71168f549cd6674c0a39\\n+\\n+Expected leases remain the eight prior remote heads below plus capture a71e43940353081e9272ee2ce068b75d3cbc94c2 and recovery c627ea6233fba82722e031c4e3ceda97f833319d. All ten verified unchanged before final checks. Never touch original141d or other-agent worktree.\\n+\\n+New fixes this pass: services systemd test expected unescaped native Windows paths rather than escaped systemd syntax (actual windows-unit failure in runs34064078972/34064079030; jobs101569691941/101569689987). Corrected assertion without production change; focused unit and lint PASS. Watcher pending populated tree now reconciles after attaching watches, even reconcile=0; respects held noisy-file schedule. New test_dotfiles_watch_pending with macOS CI entry, PASS along with throttle E2E and lint. Capture retains formerly tracked uncovered paths until external command outcome (current declarations/exclusions win), and refuses external execution without experimental opt-in; capture E2E and history_bootstrap E2E PASS. Recovery docs configure decryption identity BEFORE dry-run, and journey checks every commit reachable from main for private-file absence; full journey PASS after fixing assertion subprocess variable interpolation.\\n+\\n+ACTIVE sessions: 36216 top recovery full render/lint then capture+recovery_journey+watch_pending E2Es; 19535 capture full render/lint for NEW source-link correction (src/assets/mise-extra.usage.kdl maps bootstrap/dotfiles/capture to dotfiles/capture.rs). After19535 PASS commit capture asset and generated docs, then once36216 complete rebase recovery onto new capture using old parent2310455137a2bf65dbec1ad7198be657ab421cab. Inspect clean/generated diff, atomic exact-lease push eight updated branches (services through recovery), dispatch test.yml on EACH updated head and verify SHA. No pushes yet. All other sessions complete.\\n+\\n+Need replies after push: watcher3945467924/PRRT_kwDOIvux3s6fvilu; capture3945444490/PRRT_kwDOIvux3s6fveta; capture source-link3945483184/PRRT_kwDOIvux3s6fvlIK; recovery identity-order3945445185/PRRT_kwDOIvux3s6fve1P; recovery full-history3945445186/PRRT_kwDOIvux3s6fve1Q plus duplicate3945462246/PRRT_kwDOIvux3s6fvhpA. Update descriptions12904/12905 with integration verification. CI windows failure needs fix evidence and fresh Windows run, not a claim of Windows verification locally.\\n+\\n+Only reply already posted this pass: #12903 piped-y review3945470675/PRRT_kwDOIvux3s6fvjDj dismissed/resolved with reply3945484170: separate mode and connection choices intentional; no compatibility obligation for intermediate unreleased revisions. Do not repost. Other existing review queues remain. Newly read encryption3945467630/PRRT_kwDOIvux3s6fviid concerns recipient plugin invocation in background; identity plugins are forbidden, recipient plugins use public material and NoCallbacks, need careful verification rather than blindly forbidding public-key encryption. #12903 private help caveat3945441550 remains; docs already preview says previously published content not erased, CLI help may need clarification. Auto unavailable-store fallback3945469822/PRRT_kwDOIvux3s6fvi6O is valid-looking and not fixed yet. All ten heartbeat remains ACTIVE; no merges; stack NOT settled.\\n*** End Patch\"));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a078e9-0aa3-77c0-86b8-2b3b452b2375","create_time":1788735167.842008}}}
